  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Calibrate an SEM image's pixel scale and tilt, then trace contours and place rulers, angles and edge-squared line profiles that snap to edges, and export them as CSV, polygon/GDSII files or a session file. Data used in the run: stock. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
